  "text_md": "![](<06125479b00df48e91fe2fb616292d14116d_page_4_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nNon-Profit Org\n\nU.S. Postage\n\nPAID\n\nPermit No. 151\n\nGreat Falls, MT\n\nBUFFALO\n\nCAMPAIgn\n\nBox\n\n957\n\nWEST YELLOWSTONE, MT\n\n59758\n\nBUFFALOFIELDCAMPAIGN.ORG\n\nProtecting\n\nPrinted or Recycled Paper\n\nPhoto courtesy of Michelle McCarron\n\n# Take Action Be a Voice for Wild Buffalo!\n\n# Support BFC!\n\n# Tell Gov Bullock to Leave a Wild Legacy\n\n![](<06125479b00df48e91fe2fb616292d14116d_page_4_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\nSeay\n\nPhoto by Stephany\n\nBFC\n\nIndividuals like   you contribute the majority of Buffalo Field Campaign's budget: All donations are tax deduct ible. Make a secure online contribution at BuffaloFieldCampaign.org oruse the enclosed envelope to donate by mail.\n\nMontana Governor Steve Bullock has his sights set on the White House. Tell him you take the buffalo into the booth with Ask Gov. Bullock for a new decision with involvement and comment to protect more year-round habitat for wild buffalo, including the south side of the Madison River on the Custer Gallatin National Forest, where still takes place on cattle-free land. you! voting public hazing public\n\nCome volunteer and stand with wild buffalo!\n\nVisit BuffaloFieldCampaign org for our complete Take Action page and to sign up for Updates from the Field.\n\n# Get Involved & Volunteer!\n\nYou Tube youtube com/bfcmedia\n\nContact BFC to learn about vol on the front lines, joining our summer outreach team, hosting video showings;   distributing letters, and other ways you can the to save the herds! Email info@buffalofieldcampaignorg or call (406) 646-0070. See all the details at buffalofieldcampaign orglvolunteerwith-us. spread word\n\nfacebook com/buffalowild\n\nHecanorder the Montana executive   unteering branch to start a process   and leave a that this country can be of! Phone calls are best because cant be ignored, but you can back your call up with an email. Call Gov: Bullock at (406) 444-3111 and email governor@mt.gov.  Wild is the Roam Free! public proud they Way\n\ninstagram.com /buffalofieldcampaign\n\ntwittercom/BFC_WildBison\n\n![](<06125479b00df48e91fe2fb616292d14116d_page_4_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\nPhoto by Stephany Seay, BFC\n\nIBHP\n\nFREE\n\net $\n\n13242\n\nBUFFALO\n\nIdecolnize\n\npow\n\n",
